OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 24 years after
OL,4,Aex-partner murder attempt that sparked
OL,5,Amanhunt
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who repeatedly stabbed his
OL,8,Fex-partner in a park then ran away,
OL,9,Flaunching a four-day manhunt, has been
OL,10,Fjailed for 24 years.
OL,12,FJoanne Sidaway, 49, screamed as she was
OL,13,Fattacked in the chest by James McKenna,
OL,14,F58, in the bushes of Carmarthen Park in
OL,15,FJanuary.
OL,17,FMcKenna previously pleaded guilty to
OL,18,Fwounding with intent, but found guilty
OL,19,Fof attempted murder in July.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
