OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for 24 years after
OL,4,Aex-partner murder attempt that sparked
OL,5,Amanhunt
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn Friday, Judge Paul Thomas KC said
OL,8,Fthe attack was "wholly calculated", and
OL,9,Fthat McKenna had left his ex-partner to
OL,10,Fdie in the bushes.
